="800" class="homepage-hero2__image"> </picture></div><div class="homepage-hero2__content-wrapper cell"><div class="homepage-hero2__content homepage-hero2__swoosh--on"><h1 class="homepage-hero2__h1">Connect to the Future You Want</h1><p class="homepage-hero2__subhead">No matter where you are in life or how you show up to learn, you belong at Madison College.</p> <a class="homepage-hero2__cta button--rounded bg-yellow" href="https://madisoncollege.edu/get-started/apply">Apply Online</a></div></div></div></div><div class="homepage-hero2__swoosh homepage-hero2__swoosh--on"></div></div> </header><div class="grid-container full"><div class="grid-x grid-margin-x main-grid__wrapper"> <main id="main" class="cell" role="main"><div class="region-highlighted panel"><div data-drupal-messages-fallback class="hidden"></div></div> <a id="main-content"></a> <section><div><div id="block-mc-future-content" data-block-plugin-id="system_main_block" class="block-mc-future-content block block-system block-system-main-block"> <article id="node-3906" ><div class="view-mode-full"><div class="field field-node--field-homepage-plug-and-play field--name--field-homepage-plug-and-play field--type--entity-reference-revisions field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--layout paragraph--view-mode--default"><div class="grid-container grid-container__wrapper-padding grid-container__wrapper-padding--narrow-bottom"><div class="grid-x grid-padding-x"><div class="cell medium-12"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--text-editor paragraph--view-mode--default"><div class="field field-paragraph--field-par-text-editor field--name--field-par-text-editor field--type--text-long field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item"><h2 class="text-align-center">Your Choice for an Affordable, Flexible,&nbsp;<br>Career-Focused Education</h2></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="field-item"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--layout paragraph--view-mode--default"><div class="grid-container grid-container__wrapper-padding grid-container__wrapper-padding--narrow-top"><div class="grid-x grid-padding-x"><div class="cell medium-4"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--stat-widget paragraph--view-mode--default"><div class="stat-widget__wrapper align-middle"><div class="stat-widget__image-container stat-widget__bg-image-no-background-narrow"><div class="stat-widget__stat typography--stat-headline"><div class="field field-paragraph--field-stat-widget-stat field--name--field-stat-widget-stat field--type--string field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item">#1 in Transfers</div></div></div></div></div><div class="stat-widget__copy stat-widget__copy--no-background-narrow font-charcoal"><div class="field field-paragraph--field-stat-widget-text field--name--field-stat-widget-text field--type--string field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item">We&#039;re the top source of transfers to the University of Wisconsin system with more than 140 transfer pathways.</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--text-editor paragraph--view-mode--default"><div class="field field-paragraph--field-par-text-editor field--name--field-par-text-editor field--type--text-long field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item"><p class="text-align-center"><a class="list--bold-text" href="/node/2981">About College Transfer</a></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="cell medium-4"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--stat-widget paragraph--view-mode--default"><div class="stat-widget__wrapper align-middle"><div class="stat-widget__image-container stat-widget__bg-image-no-background-narrow"><div class="stat-widget__stat typography--stat-headline"><div class="field field-paragraph--field-stat-widget-stat field--name--field-stat-widget-stat field--type--string field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item">91% Employed</div></div></div></div></div><div class="stat-widget__copy stat-widget__copy--no-background-narrow font-charcoal"><div class="field field-paragraph--field-stat-widget-text field--name--field-stat-widget-text field--type--string field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item">91% of our graduates are employed within six months of receiving their Madison College degree.</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--text-editor paragraph--view-mode--default"><div class="field field-paragraph--field-par-text-editor field--name--field-par-text-editor field--type--text-long field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item"><p class="text-align-center"><a class="list--bold-text" href="/academics/programs">View All Programs</a></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="cell medium-4"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--stat-widget paragraph--view-mode--default"><div class="stat-widget__wrapper align-middle"><div class="stat-widget__image-container stat-widget__bg-image-no-background-narrow"><div class="stat-widget__stat typography--stat-headline"><div class="field field-paragraph--field-stat-widget-stat field--name--field-stat-widget-stat field--type--string field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item">7 Campuses</div></div></div></div></div><div class="stat-widget__copy stat-widget__copy--no-background-narrow font-charcoal"><div class="field field-paragraph--field-stat-widget-text field--name--field-stat-widget-text field--type--string field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item">Start your journey close to home with unique programs and services at seven locations across the region.</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--text-editor paragraph--view-mode--default"><div class="field field-paragraph--field-par-text-editor field--name--field-par-text-editor field--type--text-long field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item"><p class="text-align-center"><a class="list--bold-text" href="/student-experience/campuses" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="71f7ea5e-6cfe-4ef3-8b5e-0e9f3e90126d" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Campuses">Explore Our Campuses</a></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="field-item"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--layout paragraph--view-mode--default bg-light-grayish-blue"><div class="grid-container grid-container__wrapper-padding"><div class="grid-x grid-padding-x"><div class="cell medium-6"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--text-editor paragraph--view-mode--default"><div class="field field-paragraph--field-par-text-editor field--name--field-par-text-editor field--type--text-long field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item"><h2>Lowest Tuition Compared to Area Colleges</h2></div></div></div></div><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--text-editor paragraph--view-mode--default"><div class="field field-paragraph--field-par-text-editor field--name--field-par-text-editor field--type--text-long field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item"><p>Start your bachelor's degree at Madison College and save an average of $15,000 on your annual tuition.</p><figure role="group"><div><div class="field field-media--field-media-image field--name--field-media-image field--type--image field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item"> <img loading="lazy" src="/files/styles/original_webp/public/media-image/2026-03/tuition-chart_mar2026_1.png.webp?itok=wSfffWwt" width="1150" height="840" alt="A chart shows estimated expenses of $4,977 for an academic year at Madison College."></div></div></div></div><figcaption><em>(Source: College Navigator 2024-2025)&nbsp;</em></figcaption></figure></div></div></div></div><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--text-editor paragraph--view-mode--default"><div class="field field-paragraph--field-par-text-editor field--name--field-par-text-editor field--type--text-long field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item"><div>&nbsp;</div><p><a class="list--bold-text" href="/paying-for-college" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="b02bc409-1a22-42f0-b8e8-a7ed8bad7c88" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Paying for College">Learn About Paying for College</a></p><div>&nbsp;</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="cell medium-5 medium-offset-1"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--large-story-widget paragraph--view-mode--default"><div class="lrg-story-widget__wrapper lrg-story-widget__bg-color-yellow"><div class="lrg-story-widget__image"><div class="field field-paragraph--field-lrg-story-widget-img field--name--field-lrg-story-widget-img field--type--image field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item"> <img loading="lazy" src="/files/styles/original_webp/public/2026-02/image%20246.png.webp?itok=z_YzPJQt" width="639" height="455" alt="A student works with lab equipment in class." /></div></div></div></div><div class="lrg-story-widget__wysiwyg-wrapper"><div class="lrg-story-widget__wysiwyg"><div class="field field-paragraph--field-lrg-story-widget-wysiwyg field--name--field-lrg-story-widget-wysiwyg field--type--text-long field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item"><p>"Madison College gave me the best of both worlds. I had an awesome time as a student, especially in my internship. When I transferred to UW-Madison, I felt totally ready for university life."</p><p><strong>Jessica B.</strong></p><p>University Transfer Graduate</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="field-item"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--layout paragraph--view-mode--default bg-dark-blue"><div class="grid-container grid-container__wrapper-padding"><div class="grid-x grid-padding-x"><div class="cell medium-12"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--text-editor paragraph--view-mode--default"><div class="field field-paragraph--field-par-text-editor field--name--field-par-text-editor field--type--text-long field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item"><h2>See Yourself at Madison College</h2></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="field-item"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--layout paragraph--view-mode--default bg-dark-blue"><div class="grid-container grid-container__wrapper-padding grid-container__wrapper-padding--narrow-top"><div class="grid-x grid-padding-x"><div class="cell medium-6"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--text-editor paragraph--view-mode--default"><div class="field field-paragraph--field-par-text-editor field--name--field-par-text-editor field--type--text-long field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item"><div><div class="field field-media--field-media-image field--name--field-media-image field--type--image field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item"> <img loading="lazy" src="/files/styles/original_webp/public/media-image/2026-11/mc-student-reading-laptop-800x525.jpg.webp?itok=EsgSfdq9" width="800" height="525" alt="Student reading by large window smiling with a laptop in front of her"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="cell medium-5 medium-offset-1"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--text-editor paragraph--view-mode--default"><div class="field field-paragraph--field-par-text-editor field--name--field-par-text-editor field--type--text-long field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item"><p>&nbsp;</p><p class="lead">Tour our facilities, meet with a recruiter, get help with your application and more.</p><p>We offer daily tours for individuals, parents, guardians and guests. Or schedule a group tour for prospective middle or high school students.</p><p><a class="button--wysiwyg" href="/get-started/visit" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="876bf886-3a4f-45d4-b19b-78121afbb690" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Visit Madison College">View Tour and Support Options</a></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="field-item"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--layout paragraph--view-mode--default bg-dark-blue"><div class="grid-container grid-container__wrapper-padding"><div class="grid-x grid-padding-x"><div class="cell medium-6"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--text-editor paragraph--view-mode--default"><div class="field field-paragraph--field-par-text-editor field--name--field-par-text-editor field--type--text-long field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item"><p class="lead">Choose the path to help you reach your goals.</p><p>There's more to Madison College than our state-of-the-art facilities and world-class hands-on learning.</p><ul><li>Eleven areas of study</li><li>Transfer options to four-year institutions</li><li>Study abroad</li><li>College credit in high school</li><li>Skill refreshers&nbsp;</li><li>Professional growth</li><li>Learning for fun</li></ul><p><a class="button--wysiwyg" href="/academics">Explore Academics and Training</a></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="cell medium-6"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--text-editor paragraph--view-mode--default"><div class="field field-paragraph--field-par-text-editor field--name--field-par-text-editor field--type--text-long field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item"><div class="align-center"><div class="youtube-video__wrapper"> <button data-open="mc-media-6801" class="youtube-video__link"> <img class="youtube-video__thumbnail" alt="Madison College Graduates Are Everywhere" src="/files/styles/video/public/oembed_thumbnails/eElOFWjtBCRQqrmESPl29dZemd1K8HsyY-9KB6pyEx4.jpg.webp?itok=_diJks_R" width="690" height="388" loading="lazy"> </button><div class="reveal large media-remote-video youtube-video__reveal" id="mc-media-6801" data-reveal data-reset-on-close="true" data-youtube-id="h3opTl7UAPA"> <button class="youtube-video__reveal-close-button close-button" data-close aria-label="Exit video popup" type="button"> <span aria-hidden="true">×</span> </button><div class="youtube-video__inner responsive-embed widescreen"><iframe class="embed-responsive-item" src id="video-iframe--mc-media-6801" allowscriptaccess="always" allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen" frameborder="0" modestbranding="0"></iframe></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--text-editor paragraph--view-mode--default"><div class="field field-paragraph--field-par-text-editor field--name--field-par-text-editor field--type--text-long field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item"><p class="small-paragraph text-align-center"><em>Madison College graduates are everywhere.</em></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="field-item"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--layout paragraph--view-mode--default"><div class="grid-container grid-container__wrapper-padding"><div class="grid-x grid-padding-x"><div class="cell medium-12"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--large-story-widget paragraph--view-mode--default"><div class="lrg-story-widget__wrapper lrg-story-widget__bg-color-light-grayish-blue"><div class="lrg-story-widget__image"><div class="field field-paragraph--field-lrg-story-widget-img field--name--field-lrg-story-widget-img field--type--image field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item"> <img loading="lazy" src="/files/styles/original_webp/public/2026-02/Frame%201000004603.png.webp?itok=S85Oc6zu" width="639" height="447" alt="A diverse group of students talks about college life." /></div></div></div></div><div class="lrg-story-widget__wysiwyg-wrapper"><div class="lrg-story-widget__wysiwyg"><div class="field field-paragraph--field-lrg-story-widget-wysiwyg field--name--field-lrg-story-widget-wysiwyg field--type--text-long field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item"><p class="lead">You belong at Madison College.</p><p>Our commitment to equity extends to all of our campuses, organized sports, student services and 56 clubs and organizations.</p><p><a class="list--bold-text" href="/student-experience" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="a6c350d7-c70f-4ffc-b0d2-09798bd31a7b" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="The Student Experience">Discover the Student Experience</a></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="field-item"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--layout paragraph--view-mode--default"><div class="grid-container grid-container__wrapper-padding"><div class="grid-x grid-padding-x"><div class="cell medium-12"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--text-editor paragraph--view-mode--default"><div class="field field-paragraph--field-par-text-editor field--name--field-par-text-editor field--type--text-long field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item"><h2 class="text-align-center">Madison College News and Events</h2></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="field-item"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--layout paragraph--view-mode--default"><div class="grid-container grid-container__wrapper-padding grid-container__wrapper-padding--narrow-top grid-container__wrapper-padding--narrow-bottom"><div class="grid-x grid-padding-x"><div class="cell medium-12"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--article-widget paragraph--view-mode--default article-widget"><div class="article-widget--show-3"><div class="views-element-container"><div class="article-widget__view grid-x grid-padding-x article-widget--view js-view-dom-id-ea7d753eb72157801a33a36986feff160ceb75f2e4534e22c2005c93718545a9"><div class="cell"><div class="article-widget__image"> <img loading="lazy" src="/files/styles/news_7_columns/public/news/2026-10/News%20cover%20%2817%29.jpg.webp?itok=BavsNAWD" width="600" height="315" alt="An exterior photo of Goodman South Early Learning Campus showing light tan brick, three exterior windows, and a blue and white Madison College logo." /></div><div class="article-widget__title"><a href="/about/news/goodman-south-campus-solar-project-will-power-learning-and-sustainability" hreflang="en">Goodman South Campus solar project will power learning and sustainability</a></div><div class="article-widget__published-date"><time datetime="2026-11-02T12:00:00Z">November 2, 2026</time></div><div class="article-widget__summary">The college received a $167,824 Energy Innovation Grant Program award to help fund the installation. The system is expected to generate about 35% of the building’s annual electricity needs.</div></div><div class="cell"><div class="article-widget__image"> <img loading="lazy" src="/files/styles/news_7_columns/public/news/2026-10/News%20cover%20%2814%29_0.jpg.webp?itok=-qjx5sTM" width="600" height="315" alt="Dental hygiene student wearing green scrubs and a white face mask, using an instrument to clean the teeth of a patient lying on a beige dental exam chair." /></div><div class="article-widget__title"><a href="/about/news/madison-college-grads-earn-high-marks-95-employers-would-hire-again" hreflang="en">Madison College grads earn high marks: 95% of employers would hire again</a></div><div class="article-widget__published-date"><time datetime="2026-11-02T12:00:00Z">November 2, 2026</time></div><div class="article-widget__summary">Graduates earn positive reviews from local employers surveyed, saying they are satisfied with graduates’ education and would hire them again.</div></div><div class="cell"><div class="article-widget__image"> <img loading="lazy" src="/files/styles/news_7_columns/public/news/2026-10/News%20cover%20%2811%29.jpg.webp?itok=jw9OWZNQ" width="600" height="315" alt="Woman with long dark hair, wearing gray hoodie, and woman with blonde hair, wearing a red hoodie, sitting at a classroom desk, smiling. " /></div><div class="article-widget__title"><a href="/about/news/madison-college-partnership-offers-early-childhood-education-diploma-scholarship" hreflang="en">Madison College partnership offers Early Childhood Education Diploma scholarship for eligible students</a></div><div class="article-widget__published-date"><time datetime="2026-10-14T12:00:00Z">October 14, 2026</time></div><div class="article-widget__summary">Residents and employees in Dodge and Jefferson Counties can earn a Basic Early Childhood Educator Diploma at no cost through a scholarship partnership between Madison College and the Greater Watertown Community Health Foundation (GWCHF).</div></div></div></div></div><div class="article-widget__widget-link"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="field-item"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--layout paragraph--view-mode--default"><div class="grid-container grid-container__wrapper-padding grid-container__wrapper-padding--narrow-top"><div class="grid-x grid-padding-x"><div class="cell medium-8 medium-offset-2"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--text-editor paragraph--view-mode--default"><div class="field field-paragraph--field-par-text-editor field--name--field-par-text-editor field--type--text-long field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item"><p class="text-align-center"><a class="list--bold-text" href="/about/news" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="8952db09-65c2-43ad-be48-a84bb3ef9a0e" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="News">View More News and Events</a></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="field-item"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--layout paragraph--view-mode--default"><div class="admin-only-full-width"><div ><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--reuse-full-width-widget paragraph--view-mode--default"><div class="field field-paragraph--field-full-width-widget-content field--name--field-full-width-widget-content field--type--entity-reference field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item"><article id="node-3791" class="grid-container__wrapper-padding align-center cta__wrapper"><div class="grid-container grid-container__double-small"><div class="grid-x grid-padding-x"><div class="cell small-12 medium-7"><div class="cta__headline"><div class="field field-node--field-cta-widget-headline field--name--field-cta-widget-headline field--type--string field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item">Learn More About Madison College</div></div></div></div><div class="cta__body"><div class="field field-node--field-cta-widget-body field--name--field-cta-widget-body field--type--string-long field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item">We’d love to talk with you! Complete this quick form to receive information about Madison College and our academic programs.</div></div></div></div></div><div class="cell small-12 medium-4 medium-offset-1"><div class="cta__links"><div class="field field-node--field-cta-widget-links field--name--field-cta-widget-links field--type--link field-label-hidden button--bold-text-link-alt"><div class="cta__link"> <a href="/get-started/request-information">Request Information</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></article></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div> </article></div></div> </section> </main></div></div> <footer class="footer" id="footer"><div class="grid-container grid-container__double-small footer__content"><div class="grid-x grid-padding-x"><div class="cell small-12 medium-3"> <img src="/themes/custom/mc_base21/images/Icons/MATC_Logo/Horizontal_width_168px.webp" width="168" height="94" class="footer__logo" alt="Madison Area Technical College Logo" loading="lazy" /></div><div class="cell small-12 medium-6"> <a href="/about" class="footer__links--title">About Madison College</a><ul class="footer__links-list"><li class="footer__links-list__item"> <a href="/about/leadership" class="footer__links-li